#: ../../../reference/metadata.rst:126
msgid ""
"pipx encodes path values as ``{\"__type__\": \"Path\", \"__Path__\": "
"\"<path>\"}`` so it can round-trip them across platforms. The same snapshot, "
"wrapped under ``pipx_spec_version`` and a ``venvs`` map whose entries nest "
"it under a ``metadata`` key, is what ``pipx list --output json`` emits and "
"``pipx install-all`` consumes (see :doc:`json-output`)."
msgstr ""
